mes>D.D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hazama</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Supplisson</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Turk</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Wright</surname><given-names>E.M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relaxation kinetics of the Na<sup>+</sup>/glucose cotransporter</article-title><source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source><volume>90</volume><year>1993</year><fpage>5767</fpage><lpage>5771</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8516326</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="LuandHilgemann1999a"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lu</surname><given-names>C.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hilgemann</surname><given-names>D.W.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>GAT1 (GABA:Na<sup>+</sup>:Cl<sup>&#x02212;</sup>) cotransport functionsteady state studies in giant <italic>Xenopus</italic> oocyte membrane patches</article-title><source>J. Gen. Physiol.</source><volume>114</volume><year>1999</year><fpage>429</fpage><lpage>444</lpage>a<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10469733</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="LuandHilgemann1999b"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lu</surname><given-names>C.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hilgemann</surname><given-names>D.W.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>GAT1 (GABA:Na<sup>+</sup>:Cl<sup>&#x02212;</sup>) cotransport functionkinetic studies in giant <italic>Xenopus</italic> oocyte membrane patches</article-title><source>J. Gen. Physiol.</source><volume>114</volume><year>1999</year><fpage>445</fpage><lpage>457</lpage>b<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10469734</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Luetal1995"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lu</surname><given-names>C.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kabakov</surname><given-names>A.<